{
  "id": "dmanhua",
  "name": "D漫画 dmanhua",
  "lang": "cn",
  "note": "详情 /comic/<id>.html，章节 /chapter/<漫画id>-<章节id>.html。章节页不逐张列图，只下发一个目录前缀 var pasd 和总张数 var num=eval(\"41\")，图片按 前缀+序号+'.webp' 拼出来——所以要靠 pages.lazy_js 的「前缀+序号范围」模式（prefix/count），只靠选择器只能拿到 1 张 loading.svg。",
  "domains": [
    "dmanhua.com",
    "www.dmanhua.com",
    "m.dmanhua.com"
  ],
  "search_url": "https://www.dmanhua.com/search?query={q}",
  "headers": {
    "Referer": "https://www.dmanhua.com/",
    "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
  },
  "comic": {
    "title": {
      "css": "h1",
      "text": true
    },
    "cover": {
      "css": ".cover img",
      "attr": "data-src"
    },
    "author": {
      "css": ".comic-info .author, .info .author",
      "text": true
    },
    "description": {
      "css": ".description",
      "text": true
    }
  },
  "chapters": {
    "list": {
      "css": "ul.chapter-list li a, .chapter-list a, a[href*='/chapter/']"
    },
    "url_re": "/chapter/\\d+-\\d+\\.html$",
    "api": {
      "url": "https://www.dmanhua.com/comic/{id}",
      "method": "POST",
      "data": {},
      "list": "data.chapters",
      "title": "chapterName",
      "chapter_url": "/chapter/{contentId}-{id}.html",
      "headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Referer": "https://www.dmanhua.com/",
        "Origin": "https://www.dmanhua.com"
      },
      "note": "详情页只渲染 24 话（实测 5758 共 70 话、6614 共 64 话），其余藏在「加载更多」后面：页面 JS 用 fetch('/comic/'+id,{method:'POST',body:'{}'}) 拿全量。与 dingmanhua 同源模板。"
    }
  },
  "pages": {
    "list": {
      "css": ".images img.comic-image"
    },
    "url": {
      "attr": "data-src"
    },
    "lazy_js": {
      "prefix": "var\\s+pasd\\s*=\\s*[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
      "count": "var\\s+num\\s*=\\s*eval\\(\\s*[\"']?(\\d+)[\"']?\\s*\\)"
    },
    "start": 1,
    "suffix": ".webp",
    "filter": "image1\\.dmanhua\\.com/.*\\.webp(?:\\?|$)"
  },
  "search": {
    "url": "https://www.dmanhua.com/search?query={q}",
    "list": {
      "css": "div.card-content"
    },
    "link": {
      "css": "a[href]",
      "attr": "href"
    },
    "title": {
      "css": "h3.cardtitle",
      "text": "direct"
    },
    "cover": {
      "css": "img.lazy",
      "attr": "data-src"
    }
  }
}
